WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.980
We got through.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.730
Isn't this...

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.900
I'm sorry.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.500
Mimi!

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.990
Who are you?

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.380
Hey, do you recognize this place?

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.880
Sniff, sniff.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:33.760
I smell Cocona.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.510
What? As if—

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.400
I can tell!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.470
That's how much I love her!

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.760
Which way?

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.850
That way.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.480
Hang on tight!

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.160
You must be scared.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.410
Scared?

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:29.920
You're scared of being torn 
away from me again, aren't you?

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.790
But don't worry.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.200
Come what may, I'll never leave you.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:38.840
Not ever.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.040
Okay...

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.710
Good girl.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.560
You're fine just as you are.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.890
You don't need to worry 
about what people think,

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.180
or come up with your own answers anymore.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.540
After all,

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.510
the whole world will be 
painted with your brush.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.530
Antique, antique,

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.530
skip that one, and another antique!

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:05.280
Is everything here a damn fossil?

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.040
Can you get it working?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.790
That won't be a problem.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.290
You two help out, too!

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:14.990
I'm sorry.

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.100
This is about all I can do.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.050
It's fine.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.380
Cocona-chan will be okay, won't she?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.850
Papika and Yayaka will bring her back, right?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.350
Aw, yeah! It's happening!

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.720
Why did it turn out like this?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.120
Take care of the rest, Dr. Hidaka.

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:47.440
Roger!

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.620
What are you going to do, Salt-san?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.970
Use Asclepius's Box.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.260
Found her.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.600
Cocona!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.420
Who are you?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.360
Who are <i>you</i>?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:19.980
Cocona's bud.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.610
"Bud"?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.060
Her friend!

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.240
Oh?

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.660
Aren't you the only one who feels that way?

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.910
Step aside, Mimi.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.560
Why should I?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.660
Cocona doesn't want to see you.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.290
She hates liars.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.050
Let me see her!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:43.690
Do you have an answer this time, then?

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.350
Who do you really want back?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.430
Cocona? Or...

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.640
Both!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.740
My dear Cocona, and my gentle Mimi!

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.930
Give them both back!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.560
I see.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.080
Go, Yayaka!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.070
Gotcha!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.660
Papika...

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:05.040
You want to take Cocona from me, too?

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.870
Then, you can disappear...

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.530
leaving no trace behind!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:20.580
What's going on?

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.340
This is...

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.140
Flip Flapping!

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:32.580
Tch.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.540
Where's Cocona?

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.240
We don't have time for this!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.770
Where's the exit?

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:51.910
This way.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.650
I've been here with Cocona before.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:05:59.770
Are we there yet?

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:00.330
That's it.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:01.670
Don't kid around!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.090
I'm not kidding around!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.760
I'm going to save Cocona!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.040
I guess so.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:07.870
Yep!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.180
Ow...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.360
Are you serious?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.440
If you're coming with me,
stay on your toes.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.080
G-Got it!

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:10.410
Nobody here.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:23.780
Onii-chan!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.040
Fine...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.370
Hey. You eat up, too.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.440
Can I really?

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.310
Yeah. This place looks like trouble.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.910
I remember you.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.580
What you did to me really hurt, you know.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.410
It's her!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.830
I'll repay you...

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.840
by beating, crushing,

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:11.320
smashing, and pulverizing you to death!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.600
You stay out of this.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:26.480
Why, you...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:31.110
I get that you want me to make you feel 
good, but you'll have to get in line.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.030
And it's my turn right now, right?

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:42.040
Is this the kind of thing you're into?

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.940
Yeah, keep talking.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.180
How's that? Does it feel good?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.080
You want more?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.010
Yayaka!

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.940
Soon...

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:00.290
Soon, everyone trying to pull us apart

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.020
will be gone.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:08.110
Hey, where are your cute partners?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:11.110
Did it take three of you 
to do the work of one?

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:14.310
Can't you do anything by yourself?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.510
Ah!

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.870
So they decided you were no longer useful.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.030
Shut up...

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:23.500
You scumbag!

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.200
Amorphous child.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.600
What are you doing?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.890
Forget him.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.120
Treat me.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.930
This is an order.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.440
Shut up.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.960
What Yayaka would say.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:02.700
Is that...

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.590
Pure Illusion?!

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.130
Yayaka!

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.260
The amorphous...

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.590
What to do? What to do?

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.230
Yayaka! Your treasure!

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:28.980
What?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:32.980
Think about what you treasure most!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:37.010
What the hell is she talking about?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:40.890
Tch...

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:44.260
If this dumb thing can grant wishes,

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:49.120
I wish I could see her just one more time.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:53.120
At first, I was only acting under orders,

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.380
but then I finally found where I belonged...

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.670
Next to her, where I loved to be.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.380
So...

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:03.140
Yayaka's my friend!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.680
I have to apologize.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:11.130
I don't know if you'll ever forgive 
me for lying to you all these years,

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.750
but I'm so sorry!

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.220
If you can find it in 
your heart to forgive me,

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.750
can we be friends again...

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.700
Yayaka!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.710
What I treasure most...

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:37.210
is Cocona!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.740
Flip Flapping!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:25.180
Transformed.

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:26.740
Awesome.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:29.510
Dear me, Cocona.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.020
You really need to pick your friends better.

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:34.980
Give Cocona...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.480
...back!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.920
Don't look down.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.760
What are we even here for?!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.410
A piece of equipment that 
was developed and put away

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.370
in the early stages of 
Pure Illusion research.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.860
It's called ELPIS.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.130
And that thing's here?

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.390
Yeah.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.850
He was obsessed with it, so I'm sure.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:30.030
I found the underground entrance over there.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.300
Salt-san?

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.120
The time has come.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.350
Boop that switch.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.250
M-U-S-C-L-E.

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.080
Activating Idiom Mode.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.040
Updating system.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.340
STR increased by 8.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:28.380
STA increased by 9.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.270
INT increased by 1.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.520
What? Impossible!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.300
Salt-san...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.030
Cocona!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.780
Give Cocona back!

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:53.060
Cocona can't make her own choices,

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.540
so I must make all the decisions for 
her so she doesn't lose her way.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.460
That ain't right!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.320
My, even when you transform 
into such a cute little thing,

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.880
I see your mouth is still filthy.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.130
Oh, screw you!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:08.880
Why are you trying to take 
Cocona's mother away from her?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.640
You know deep down that this is all wrong!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.740
That's not true.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.520
This is what Cocona and I both wanted.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.580
No! I mean—

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:23.040
Tch. Not again.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.230
No fair!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.540
Watch the place while I'm away.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.200
I know you can do it.

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.550
You're a very good girl.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.550
Yes, Mom.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.550
Damn, we were almost there.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.350
Cocona!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.760
Damn you...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.340
Talk about hard.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.740
Come on! Cocona's right there!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.840
Papika!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:37.370
Hey.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.430
Listen to me. Shut up and follow my lead.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:50.730
Yayaka!

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:54.990
Yayaka!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.570
Get past it!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.160
Yayaka...

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.160
Cocona!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.420
Papika?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.240
You never know when to give up.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.200
You're so persistent, so stubborn,

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.090
and you intrude in people 
without a care in the world!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.520
I hate you!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.810
I hate, hate, <i>hate</i> you!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.450
Stop this, Mimi!

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.560
Give Cocona back!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.640
Give her back? What are you talking about?

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.270
This is a wonderful world I created for her.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.050
She has her own places she holds dear!

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:39.280
That world could bring 
pain and sorrow to her.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:42.510
I cannot leave my daughter there!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.690
I must protect her...

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:47.500
Isn't that what a mother is supposed to do?!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.420
No!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.630
I mean, remember what you said?

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:59.260
She moved. What will you name her?

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.760
Actually, I've already decided.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.860
Cocona.

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:05.520
Cocona, huh?

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.140
Hey, Papika.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.150
Once Cocona is born...

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.750
Back then, you...

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.190
I, what?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.820
Huh?

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:20.800
Hey, Papika.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:26.100
Once Cocona is born, I'll stay 
with her and protect her forever.

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.710
I won't let anyone tear us apart.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.210
Not even you, Papika.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:36.090
What did I say?

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.630
Do you get it now?

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:47.310
Nobody asked you to do this.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.600
You're just a nuisance.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.840
Never come near Cocona again.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.360
I...

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:57.560
Why did you come here?

00:18:58.510 --> 00:18:59.600
Cocona.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.450
Are you really okay with this?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.830
Mom?

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:07.920
Will you do nothing but watch?

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:12.490
But you said you'd decide everything for me

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.520
because I'm too indecisive 
to make my own choices.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.870
That's how I've always been.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.330
I couldn't decide on a career path.

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:24.430
And I only went on adventures 
because Papika dragged me along.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.160
It's not that you can't 
make your own choices.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:30.140
You just lacked a tiny bit of courage.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.680
You were just a tiny bit afraid of failure.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:34.560
But, you know,

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.060
that's nothing out of the ordinary.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.410
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.290
Everybody's like that.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.320
You, too?

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:44.340
Yes.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.200
And I'm sure your father, too.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.620
You must choose for yourself

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:52.330
the world you want to be a part of.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.740
Papika.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.430
Papika!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.690
Cocona?

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:11.460
Papika! Papika!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.480
Hey, Papika!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.150
Papika.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:21.400
Please remember what I wished for.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.990
Hey, Papika.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:26.270
Once Cocona is born,

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:28.310
I want her to choose her own path

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.290
and live life the way she sees fit.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.170
I want her to have the freedom

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:37.970
that I never had.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.420
<i>I won't lose my way anymore!</i>

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.930
<i>Because I know!</i>

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:51.430
<i>I've always loved you, 
ever since you were born!</i>

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.440
<i>I won't run away anymore, either.</i>

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.920
<i>Even if I regret the choices I make,</i>

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:57.790
<i>I'll face forward again each time.</i>

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.690
<i>So let's go together,</i>

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:01.180
<i>Papika!</i>

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.570
Who do you think is letting you transform?

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:08.650
Papika!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.330
Come on, Papika!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.580
I love, love, <i>love</i> you, Papika!

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.080
Cocona!

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:27.720
Why?

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.140
Why?!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.220
I'm your mother, you know!

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.600
Why won't you listen to me?!

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:38.310
Bad girls like you...

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.060
Let's go.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:40.910
Yeah.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.320
Knock, knock.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:32.970
I'll never let go, Papika.

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:33.680
Let's go together!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:35.140
Okay, Cocona!

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:37.640
Next time, on the final 
episode of <i>Flip Flappers:</i>

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:40.440
Pure Audio

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:38.610
"Pure Audio."

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:39.920
Look forward to it!
